Idea and inspiration are taken from QiTong AI Gateway. This fork removes the
non-gateway "combine" features (chat, memory, persona, skills, group chat, web
search), hardens network and secret handling, normalizes the OpenAI-compatible
API, and adds an AI-resource-management layer (quotas, pricing, resource-aware
routing, usage history, widget, notifications, OAuth framework).

